   "lines": [
    "New York.",
    "Made about 20 calls.",
    "A particularly",
    "pleasant one on",
    "Annie Murray;",
    "she is a singular-",
    "-ly neat girl, and",
    "one whom I wish",
    "I could see. Little",
    "Fan[?] Smith is also",
    "a great favourite",
    "of mine—a pure,",
    "religious, bright",
    "girl, well read",
    "and I think a",
    "true friend. Edith",
    "C. makes up my",
    "trio of \"Freundinnen\"."
   ],
   "rows": null,
   "columns": null,
   "confidence": "high",
   "note": "'Fan' could also be read 'Fal'"
  }
